@startuml
title MCU-initiated request, with the PC answering

participant "ESP32" as MCU
participant "PC" as PC

MCU -> PC : request save_measurement\nid = esp-105
PC -> PC : store the measurement
PC --> MCU : response success\nid = esp-105

note over MCU, PC
  Either side may open a call, so both
  need a dispatcher and a pending table.
end note
@enduml
